osmetics, achievement and more!<br><br><strong>Mancala Madness Expansion</strong><br>A story mode expansion with an additional table, 2 alternate table announcers, unlockable ball, cosmetics, achievements and more!<br><br><strong>Topsy-Turvy Expansion</strong><br>A story mode expansion with an additional table, alternate table announcer, unlockable ball, cosmetics, achievements and more!<br><br><strong>Birthday Bonanza</strong><br>A 1 year anniversary expansion with an additional table, alternate table announcer, unlockable ball, cosmetics, achievements and more!<br><br><strong>Bowling Bash Expansion</strong><br>A story mode expansion with an additional table, alternate table announcer, unlockable ball, cosmetics, achievements and more!<br><br><strong>Survival, Time Attack and Score Attack</strong><br>Three new game modes available for every table; Compete in online leaderboards, unlock achievements and unlock additional characters!<br><br><strong>Rapid Ryan’s Arcade</strong><br>A constantly expanding collection of minigames and pinball themed variations of arcade classics; Pachinko, Whac-A-Mole and many, many more!<br><br><strong>Customization and Unlockable Characters!</strong><br>More unlockable cosmetics, customization options and an expanding roster of unlockable characters!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807690/extras/e7bb0ee8e92d8980b2aeba65fa4053ff.poster.avif?t=1742189396\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807690/extras/e7bb0ee8e92d8980b2aeba65fa4053ff.webm?t=1742189396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1807690/extras/e7bb0ee8e92d8980b2aeba65fa4053ff.mp4?t=1742189396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "When a power hungry, egotistical witch spreads her 